          "requirement_id": "TFQM-AUTH-REVIEW-AUTH-RICE-THEOREM-IMPORT-3"
        },
        {
          "requirement": "Report executed finite obligations only, including identity descent and code-zero non-descent, while retaining the imported infinite Rice theorem boundary.",
